# Build context is the repo root (deploy/droplet/*.Dockerfile).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.expo
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.github
.agents
.claude
.cursor
brand
screenshots
reviews
devlogs
e2e
supabase
docs
*.md
!apps/**/README.md
**/.DS_Store

# Local env files hold dev values. Expo and Next read .env files at build time,
# so letting one into the context would bake dev URLs into a production image.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
